=== start ===
I also explored 2D platformer level design in this project, specifically for the lava and spikes hazard levels.
Want to hear about the design philosophy behind it?
+ [Yes] -> technical_detail
+ [No] -> END

=== technical_detail ===
It was an interesting design experience because I had to build levels around a core mechanic where the player has a limited amount of time to stay alive.

I had to strategically place healing pickups and obstacles in a specific way that plays with the player's perceived sense of urgency, forcing them to take risks.
Fun!
-> END